	(text "SIGNAL DIRECTION NOTES\n---------\n LP  -	IN to antic\nRNMI -	IN to antic (held high)\nNMI  -	OUT to cpu\nREF	 -	OUT to computer\nHALT -	OUT to cpu (read memory)\nR/W  -	IN or Bi-dir, unsure\nRDY  -	OUT to cpu (WSYNC)\nFI0  -	IN clk from gtia\n o2  -	OUT clk to cpu (buffered, U18D)\n o0  -	IN clk from cpu (buffered, U18B)\nRST  -	IN from computer\n\n"
